    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Question\n\n`force` or `keep`?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/6f11e41a137590e4a5f13624a2a9a845686e719f/lua/mini/pick.lua#L1411",
