            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Can you please elaborate on why do you think they should be overridable? What do you try to achieve here?\r\n\r\n`grep_live` is a very special picker with a very special `source.match`.\r\n\r\n`<C-o>` as a special picker mapping is [documented](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/6f11e41a137590e4a5f13624a2a9a845686e719f/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1144) and fixed.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Can you please elaborate on why do you think they should be overridable? What do you try to achieve here?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">grep_live</code> is a very special picker with a very special <code class=\"notranslate\">source.match</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-o&gt;</code> as a special picker mapping is <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/6f11e41a137590e4a5f13624a2a9a845686e719f/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1144\">documented</a> and fixed.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Can you please elaborate on why do you think they should be overridable? What do you try to achieve here?\ngrep_live is a very special picker with a very special source.match.\n<C-o> as a special picker mapping is documented and fixed.",
